### 3. Engineering Obstacles Overcome

| Obstacle Encountered | Underlying Cause | Final Solution |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **`PEP 668: externally-managed-environment`** | Debian/Ubuntu restricts direct system-wide `pip install` | Installed via `--break-system-packages` flag (or isolated in virtual environment). |
| **`-bash: !': event not found`** | Bash interprets exclamation marks inside double quotes as history expansion | Escaped exclamation mark or tested strings using single quotes. |
| **`404 NOT_FOUND (gemini-2.5-flash)`** | Legacy model deprecated for new developer accounts | Upgraded to the current default: `gemini-3.8-flash`. |
| **Terminal freezing / slow response** | `gemini-3.8-flash` ran default medium-reasoning mode | Added `thinking_config=ThinkingConfig(thinking_level="LOW")` for sub-2s responses. |
| **`503 UNAVAILABLE`** | Temporary compute spike on Google cloud infrastructure | Added exponential backoff retry loops and multi-model fallbacks. |

