### 4. Global Shell Integration

By placing the binary in `~/.local/bin/git-ai` and adding that directory to `$PATH`, Git recognizes it as an internal subcommand:

```bash
# Add to shell profile (~/.bashrc)
export GEMINI_API_KEY="AQ.Ab8RN..."
export PATH="$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH"

# Quick setup command
chmod +x ~/.local/bin/git-ai

```

